OL,3,GNEWSATwo in court after six people
OL,4,Afound in lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman have appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt after six people were found in
OL,8,Fthe back of a lorry in Goole.
OL,10,FFlorin Anghel, 27, and Tita Istrate,
OL,11,F24, had been charged with doing an act
OL,12,Fto facilitate the commission of a
OL,13,Fbreach of UK immigrational law by a
OL,14,Fnon-UK national.
OL,16,FAnghel, who identifies as Italian, and
OL,17,FIstrate, who identifies as Romanian,
OL,18,Fboth pleaded not guilty to two counts
OL,19,Fof the offence at Hull Crown Court
OL,20,Fearlier.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
